UnifiedAudioControl.zip

# Build artifacts master_build.sh writes into the repo root. The bundled binary
# was committed three times before it was removed from tracking; nothing stopped
# a `git add` from re-adding it until this rule existed.
UnifiedAudioControl.app/
Assets/AppIcon.iconset/

# Written by the claude-md-updater hook after every commit; local notes, never shared.
CLAUDE.local.md

# Per-machine agent scratch (.cc-writes, agent-memory, worktrees). Re-created on its own
# every session, so leaving it untracked meant every `git status` here opened dirty and
# every automated sweep had to decide afresh whether that dirt was real work.
.claude/
